  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "AI深度學習於大數據分析",
    "sub_ename": "AI DEEP LEARNING FOR BIG DATA ANALYTICS",
    "describe_ch": "人工智慧是一門「認知科學」，幫助人類探索生活中增加智慧化的機會，對於精密工業應用更是一個系統工程，能重複、有效、可靠地解決問題。人工智慧的系統工程方法，從傳統數據回歸演算法（Algorithm）以及以類神經網路算法為核心的思維，進展到以多系統整合（亦即算法、算力跟各種獨立模型工具的使用）。本課程以類神經網路為基礎，進展到基礎影像識別、語音與語言模型的概論說明，課堂使用python程式設計工具讓學生可以應用落實於實際場域的方式來展現人工智慧的價值。",
    "describe_eh": "Artificial intelligence is a branch of \"cognitive science\" that helps humans explore opportunities to increase intelligence in their lives. It is a systematic engineering approach, particularly beneficial for precision industrial applications, as it enables the repetitive, efficient, and reliable resolution of problems. The system engineering methods of artificial intelligence have evolved from traditional data regression algorithms to neural network algorithms at their core, and further progressed to incorporate multiple systems integration, including the use of algorithms, computing power, and various independent model tools. This course is based on neural networks and progresses to provide an overview of basic image recognition, speech, and language models. Python programming tools are used in the classroom to allow students to apply and demonstrate the value of artificial intelligence in practical scenarios.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "理解深度學習的基本概念和原理，知道常見的深度學習模型和算法，了解AI大數據分析中的挑戰和機會。",
      "describe_en": "Understanding the basic concepts and principles of deep learning, familiarizing with common deep learning models and algorithms, and gaining knowledge about the challenges and opportunities in AI big data analytics."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能夠選擇和應用適當的深度學習模型處理大數據，理解如何設計和調整深度學習模型以達到最佳性能，並能夠使用深度學習工具和軟件庫進行實際的大數據分析項目。",
      "describe_en": "Being able to select and apply appropriate deep learning models for handling big data, understanding how to design and adjust deep learning models for optimal performance, and utilizing deep learning tools and software libraries for practical big data analytics projects."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "能夠評估深度學習模型在大數據分析中的利用深度學習模型來預測結果，並提供分析洞見和解釋。",
      "describe_en": "Being able to evaluate the utilization of deep learning models in big data analytics, predict outcomes using deep learning models, and provide analysis insights and explanations."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "能夠進行模型優化和改進，以提高分析結果的準確性和效能。",
      "describe_en": "Being able to optimize and improve models to enhance the accuracy and performance of the analysis results."
    }
  ],
